<details class="workspace-upload-help"><summary><?= __('CSV requirements and import guidance') ?></summary><div class="workspace-upload-help-content"><div><h2><?= __('File and member details') ?></h2><p><?= __('Upload a UTF-8 membership CSV, up to 10 MB. Columns may appear in any order.') ?></p><ul><li><?= __('Required: membership number, first name, last name, and start date (for example, 02 Dec 2024).') ?></li><li><?= __('A nonblank preferred name is used instead of first name.') ?></li><li><?= __('Communication email and contact number are added when a member has no existing contacts.') ?></li><li><?= __('New members use their earliest start date as their join date.') ?></li></ul></div><div><h2><?= __('Appointments and matching') ?></h2><ul><li><?= __('End dates use the start-date format. Omit the column to preserve an existing end date, or leave a value blank to clear it.') ?></li><li><?= __('Members are matched by membership number. Repeat imports update matching appointments.') ?></li><li><?= __('Mappings and Skip choices are remembered after a successful import.') ?></li><li><?= __('Invalid rows roll back the whole member import. Unit mappings are saved separately.') ?></li></ul></div></div></details>
